ess_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"voWjA6zfmXLIbKAoqwBnug","review_id":"veIHyt_D6w0r1nh84fGp1A","date":"2016-01-29T05:38:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9531475305557251,"text_excerpt":"If I ever told anyone I went to a vegan/vegetarian restaurant when I was on vacation in NOLA, they would look at me as if I'm crazy. But my girls and I were looking for an healthier option since we were eating too much good BUT heavy foods for every single meal (you know that feeling when you just eat to the point where you hate yourself but can't stop because all the food you're consuming is just too darn good?). We found this place thanks to Yelp and upon walking in, this place is really a hole in the wall. But it didn't matter to me because everything else was excellent. I do want to point out that this isn't just a vegan/vegetarian restaurant. There is meat! Very good meat! So meat lo..."},{"business_id":"voWjA6zfmXLIbKAoqwBnug","review_id":"uAgqDo118qZh3uhL684u6Q","date":"2013-03-06T23:13:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9517488479614258,"text_excerpt":"Went here for lunch. They have a few vegetarian options, certainly more than other places in NOLA but not what I expected based on Yelp telling me that vegetarians love this place. The drinks are amazing--I had a mint julep and one with bourbon and lemon that was great. Food was amazing. We started with a tomato dish with cheese and balsamic vinegar. The lentil pancake was great, nice spices and delicious. I had grits and they were awesome. We sat outside and it was perfect since you were down a little alley so it was quiet. Based on reviews, I was worried about service but it was great. Fast, attentive and nice."},{"business_id":"voWjA6zfmXLIbKAoqwBnug","review_id":"QHvgoPhI6Yvbw7fdl5DVtQ","date":"2019-06-10T02:54:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9465444087982178,"text_excerpt":"We almost licked the plates. This place has a very nice menu, vegetarian, gluten-free, meat options, lighter or not so much. They have a nice drink menu as well. I ordered the Green Goddess Wedge with an add of Duck sausages. It doesn't need the sausage, but I wanted to try it. I got the half salad as my meal, it was a full size. She had the Citrus Hong, loved it; this is such and interesting dish. Finished with a vegan bananas foster, delicious. We sat outside along the patio, it was perfect weather."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"voWjA6zfmXLIbKAoqwBnug","photo_id":"MD77KCkKjJOSXpi7GoK_hw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MD77KCkKjJOSXpi7GoK_hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8870255947113037},{"business_id":"voWjA6zfmXL